,187,158,163,153,134,153,139,134,105,96,86,100,91,81,105,81,77,96,81,81,86,100,91,91,77,53,72,77,91,96,650,531,603,1215,1138,1243,1339,1224,1100,1291,1023,875,780,650,517,636,526,440,512,435,380,280,260,220,180,140,300,280,305,305,220,205,250,215,215,220,220,230,240,225,220,205,210,200,215,205,215,205,190,170,145,130,135,125,110,95,100,105,105,95,75,85,80,80,75,70,60,65,65,70,75,65,75,90,90,95],"v":[24345500,34879200,74030100,64530600,68615300,39630100,15343200,36381500,45506700,26702000,17406600,17825200,9632100,16355500,8742000,14622500,8907200,3417100,9580200,26309700,12814500,6563800,5594200,4840900,4629600,5594300,1481400,5681300,22843300,6053100,5395200,13358700,7364100,3904900,5037300,21747000,12959100,8696200,6258100,12758400,21319400,14189900,77890700,50354100,1243037100,995943400,660907800,1213546200,1212151300,432044600,489490300,398303100,216096400,202978000,325548200,233698300,85907400,107408000,39489500,284808400,63104900,39736300,53017800,24427400,16462800,18424600,21549100,20300500,16502700,17270900,136220200,298530000,197509900,85576600,57073900,39416900,63011000,50730100,33321000,32461700,15321300,30059300,45042000,45349200,28825100,20770200,5549200,11902900,15149600,37701700,29513700,14226100,6998700,7335000,34356100,7292900,32934100,3453500,2017200,4822700,10009300,26006800,16209800,6386200,4518200,2137200,7405100,2459500,1299900,2020700,1594300,53794300,2880300,4057200,2162800,5910700,33114000,19216300,7162800,2353600]}},"profile":{"website":"https://solutiongroup.com.my","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","employees":62,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Solution Group Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the technology, renewable energy, biotechnology, and healthcare businesses in Malaysia and internationally. The company designs and develops equipment and software for engineering education and research, as well as technical and vocational education and training in the chemical, mechanical, electrical, civil, control engineering, and renewable energy areas; and offers laboratory and industrial biotechnology solutions, such as design and development of equipment and processes for manufacturing products used in the biotechnology and pharmaceutical industries under the SOLTEQ brand. It also provides automation solutions for industrial plants and processes, waterworks, and flood mitigation; and solutions for plant construction projects, as well as produces and distributes industrial lubricants under the SOLMAX brand; fabrication for pressurized vessels, heat exchangers, storage tanks, structures, and process skids assembly; and promotes businesses relating to green and renewal energy. In addition, the company offers training and curriculum content; designs and develops ultrasonic solvent extraction of oil from spent adsorbent project, as well as pilot plant for biolubricant projects and industrial lubricants; sells wellness, lifestyle, and other products; and formulates, fills, finishes, markets, and distributes biological drugs. Further, the company engages in the wholesale of pharmaceuticals and medical goods; manufacturing of other pharmaceuticals, medical chemical, and botanical products; and product registration, manufacturing, and commercialization of active plant compounds and products for medicinal purposes. The company was formerly known as Solution Engineering Holdings Berhad and changed its name to Solution Group Berhad in June 2019. Solution Group Berhad was incorporated in 1988 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Solution Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，业务涉及技术、可再生能源、生物技术和医疗保健领域，在马来西亚及国际开展业务。公司成立于1988年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，曾用名 Solution Engineering Holdings Berhad，于2019年6月更名。","lines":["工程教育设备与软件：设计和开发用于化学、机械、电气、土木、控制和可再生能源领域的工程教育、研究以及技术与职业教育培训的设备和软件。","生物技术解决方案：以 SOLTEQ 品牌提供实验室和工业生物技术解决方案，包括为生物技术和制药行业设计和开发设备与工艺。","自动化与工程解决方案：为工业工厂和流程、水厂和防洪提供自动化解决方案，以及工厂建设项目解决方案。","工业润滑剂：以 SOLMAX 品牌生产和分销工业润滑剂。","压力容器与结构制造：制造压力容器、热交换器、储罐、结构件和工艺撬装组装。","医疗保健产品：销售健康、生活方式等产品，并从事生物药物的配方、灌装、包装、营销和分销，以及药品和医疗用品的批发。"],"lines_en":["Engineering Education Equipment & Software: Designs and develops equipment and software for engineering education and research, as well as technical and vocational education and training in chemical, mechanical, electrical, civil, control engineering, and renewable energy areas.","Biotechnology Solutions: Offers laboratory and industrial biotechnology solutions under the SOLTEQ brand, including design and development of equipment and processes for the biotechnology and pharmaceutical industries.","Automation & Engineering Solutions: Provides automation solutions for industrial plants and processes, waterworks, and flood mitigation, as well as solutions for plant construction projects.","Industrial Lubricants: Produces and distributes industrial lubricants under the SOLMAX brand.","Fabrication for Pressure Vessels & Structures: Fabrication for pressurized vessels, heat exchangers, storage tanks, structures, and process skids assembly.","Healthcare Products: Sells wellness, lifestyle, and other products; formulates, fills, finishes, markets, and distributes biological drugs; and wholesales pharmaceuticals and medical goods."]}}